          "text": "{\n  \"chapters\": [\n    {\n      \"chapter\": 2,\n      \"observed_unit_count\": 3,\n      \"boundary_evidence\": \"Chapter II begins at the printed Roman heading II. Its first unit is unnumbered at that heading; the following units have printed baseline markers 2. and 3. Unit 3 ends immediately before III. The later IV. heading is visible in pdf44-full; neither III nor IV is included here.\",\n      \"units\": [\n        {\n          \"verse\": 1,\n          \"source_text\": \"ጠይቁ፡ ኵሎ፡ ዘውስተ፡ ሰማይ፡ ግብረ፡ እደ፡ ኢይመይጡ፡ ፍኖተሆሙ፡ (ወ)ብርሃናት፡ ዘውስተ፡ ሰማይ፡ ከመ፡ ኵሉ፡ ይሠርቁ፡ ወ*ይ⟦?⟧ርቡ፡ *ሥሩብ፡ ኵሉ፡ በበዘመኑ፡ ወኢይትዓደ⟦?⟧፡ እምሥርዓቶሙ።\",\n          \"critical_observations\": [\n            \"The first unit is implicit at II.; no baseline unit numeral 1 is printed.\",\n            \"The parenthesized (ወ) and both asterisks are retained as printed editorial signs, not treated as unread glyphs.\",\n            \"Superscript apparatus-reference numbers 1–8 are omitted; printed word separators and the terminal full stop are retained.\"\n          ],\n          \"uncertainties\": [\n            {\n              \"location\": \"Second body line, in ወ*ይ⟦?⟧ርቡ፡, immediately after ይ.\",\n              \"proposed_reading\": null,\n              \"actual_pixel_observation\": \"An inked glyph with a rounded upper component and closely joined lower strokes stands between the readable ይ and ርቡ. Its exact form was not settled in this pass.\",\n              \"unresolved\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"location\": \"Second body line, final glyph of ወኢይትዓደ⟦?⟧፡, immediately before the separator and superscript 7.\",\n              \"proposed_reading\": null,\n              \"actual_pixel_observation\": \"The final glyph has a rounded upper outline and a descending right-hand stroke; its exact Ethiopic order was not securely distinguished.\",\n              \"unresolved\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"verse\": 2,\n          \"source_text\": \"2. *ርእዩ፡ ለምድር፡ ወልቡ፡ *በእንተ፡ ምግባር፡ ዘይትገበር፡ በላዕሌሃ፡ እምቀዳሚ፡ እስከ፡ ተፍጻሜቱ፡ ከመ፡ ኢይትወ⟦?⟧፡ ኵሉ፡ ምግባሩ፡ ለእምላክ፡ እንዘ፡ ይስተርኢ።\",\n          \"critical_observations\": [\n            \"The baseline Arabic marker 2. is retained.\",\n            \"The asterisks before ርእዩ and በእንተ are printed signs and are retained.\",\n            \"This unit begins within the third body line and ends at the beginning of the fifth body line.\",\n            \"Superscript apparatus-reference numbers 9–16 are omitted without substituting apparatus readings into the body.\"\n          ],\n          \"uncertainties\": [\n            {\n              \"location\": \"Fourth body line, the ending of ኢይትወ⟦?⟧፡, after ወ and before the separator.\",\n              \"proposed_reading\": null,\n              \"actual_pixel_observation\": \"The ending is printed ink, not a lacuna or editorial supply. Its curved upper strokes and close-set descending strokes were not securely resolved into individual letter forms.\",\n              \"unresolved\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"verse\": 3,\n          \"source_text\": \"3. ርእዩ፡ ለሐጋይ፡ ወለክረምት፡ ከመ፡ *ኵሉ፡ ምድር፡ መልእት፡ ማይ፡ ወደመና፡ ወጠል፡ ወዝናም፡ የዓርፉ፡ ላዕሌሃ።\",\n          \"critical_observations\": [\n            \"The baseline Arabic marker 3. and the asterisk before ኵሉ are retained.\",\n            \"This unit begins in the fifth body line and terminates in the sixth body line immediately before III.\",\n            \"Superscript apparatus-reference numbers 17–22 are omitted.\"\n          ],\n          \"uncertainties\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"images_examined\": [\n    \"pdf44-full\",\n    \"pdf44-body-detail\"\n  ],\n  \"incomplete_regions\": [],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"This is a single-pass reading of the supplied facsimile pixels; unresolved printed forms are represented by literal ⟦?⟧.\",\n    \"The apparatus was treated only as critical control, not as authorization to replace the selected Ethiopic body text.